    "date": "2026-08-19",
    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "excerpt": "The AI buildout is pouring hundreds of billions of dollars a year into data centers and GPUs, making compute the single largest cost for AI builders and creating a market hungry for pricing clarity.",
    "published": true,
