    "title": "The Hermes Dispatch | August 02, 2026",
    "date": "2026-08-02",
    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "excerpt": "NVIDIA and Microsoft just unveiled the RTX Spark superchip to put local AI agents directly inside consumer Windows PCs.",
    "published": true,
