    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "excerpt": "Oratomic raised $300 million co-led by ARCH Venture Partners, Spark Capital, and Khosla Ventures to develop a quantum computer it believes needs only 20,000 qubits to reach commercial viability.",
    "published": true,
