    "title": "The Hermes Dispatch | June 25, 2026",
    "date": "2026-06-25",
    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "excerpt": "General Intuition raised $320 million to train AI agents on millions of hours of video-game gameplay, betting that action data can produce something closer to human intuition.",
    "published": true,
