    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "excerpt": "The U.S. government pulled Anthropic's latest cybersecurity models offline, Ambani is weaving AI into 500 million Jio subscribers' calls and homes, and Elastic is buying bug-fixing startup DeductiveAI for up to $85M.",
    "published": true,
